{
  "id": "538",
  "title": "Which is the Most Beautiful?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-10-06",
  "synopsis": "Lili asks Ben for advice on what clothes to buy.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/852/d8d4132caed781dbb014744f8709c119b6e5d7b0.mp3?1589791655",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 3: Who is Little Yu?",
    "chapter": 20,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "哪件衣服最漂亮？\n\n丽丽：本，这件红色的，这件黄色的和那件蓝色的，你觉得哪件衣服最漂亮？\n本：都漂亮。\n丽丽：我是问你哪件最漂亮。\n本：你穿什么都好看。\n丽丽：本！！\n本：好吧！我觉得这件红色的最漂亮。\n丽丽：可是我觉得那件蓝色的更好看。\n本：那就买蓝色的吧。",
    "traditional": "哪件衣服最漂亮？\n\n麗麗：本，這件紅色的，這件黃色的和那件藍色的，你覺得哪件衣服最漂亮？\n本：都漂亮。\n麗麗：我是問你哪件最漂亮。\n本：你穿什麼都好看。\n麗麗：本！！\n本：好吧！我覺得這件紅色的最漂亮。\n麗麗：可是我覺得那件藍色的更好看。\n本：那就買藍色的吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Which piece of clothing is the most beautiful?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本，这件红色的，这件黄色的和那件蓝色的，你觉得哪件衣服最漂亮？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本，這件紅色的，這件黃色的和那件藍色的，你覺得哪件衣服最漂亮？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn zhè jiàn hóng sè de zhè jiàn huáng sè de hé nà jiàn lán sè de nǐ jué de nǎ jiàn yī fu zuì piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ben, this red one, this yellow one, or that blue one. Which piece of clothing do you think is the most beautiful?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：都漂亮。",
      "traditional": "本：都漂亮。",
      "pinyin": "běn dōu piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: They’re all beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我是问你哪件最漂亮。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我是問你哪件最漂亮。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ shì wèn nǐ nǎ jiàn zuì piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I’m asking you which is the most beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：你穿什么都好看。",
      "traditional": "本：你穿什麼都好看。",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ chuān shén me dōu hǎo kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Whatever you wear is beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本！！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本！！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ben!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：好吧！我觉得这件红色的最漂亮。",
      "traditional": "本：好吧！我覺得這件紅色的最漂亮。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo ba wǒ jué de zhè jiàn hóng sè de zuì piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Alright! I think this red one is the most beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：可是我觉得那件蓝色的更好看。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：可是我覺得那件藍色的更好看。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì kě shì wǒ jué de nà jiàn lán sè de gèng hǎo kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: But I think that blue one looks better."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：那就买蓝色的吧。",
      "traditional": "本：那就買藍色的吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà jiù mǎi lán sè de ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then buy the blue one."
    }
  ],
